  "text": "Ernie's oncology story | Davies Veterinary Specialists\nPet Owners\n>\nMeet Our Team\nBeing referred to Davies\nFacilities\nThe Referral Process\nFact Sheets\nFAQ\nClient Care\nFinance and Insurance\nSustainability\nVet Professionals\n>\nAppointment Request Form\nEmergency Referrals\nRadiology Request Form\nTPLO Post Op Form\nBook CPD\nCPD Webinar Library\nPopular Downloads\nServices\n>\nAnaesthesia\nCardiology\nDentistry & Maxillofacial Surgery\nDermatology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency and Critical Care\nHearing Assessment Clinic\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nNursing\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nOrthopaedics\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nTherapy Services\nClient Care\nOur Team\n>\nAnaesthesia Team\nCardiology Team\nClient Care Team\nDentistry & Maxillofacial Surgery Team\nDermatology Team\nEmergency & Critical Care Team\nDiagnostic Imaging Team\nGreen Group\nHearing Clinic Team\nFinance Team\nInternal Medicine Team\nInterns\nLeadership Team\nNeurology Team\nNursing Team\nOncology Team\nOphthalmology Team\nOrthopaedics Team\nPain Management Team\nPatient Care Assistants and Technicians\nTherapy Services Team\nSoft Tissue Surgery Team\nSupport Team\nJoin Our Team\nContact Us\nInsights\n>\nBlogs\nNews\nFact Sheets\nCase Studies\nNewsletters\nCPD\nEmergencies\n01582 883950\nRefer Here\nLog In / Register\nUPDATE: Please be aware that our opening hours have changed on Monday 19th September. Please contact us for any emergency care.\nInsights\n/\nCase Studies\n/\nErnie’s oncology story\nErnie’s oncology story\nOncology\n20th November 2019\nErnie is referred to Davies’ Oncology service for multiple mast cell tumours\nFour years ago, Ernie was re-homed by one of Davies’ team members. Unfortunately he’s had many health problems since then and has become a familiar face to most of our services.\nThese problems have included, corneal ulcers requiring grafts from ophthalmology, aspiration pneumonia requiring treatment from internal medicine, a lung lobe torsion where soft tissue had to perform a lung lobectomy, he has Paroxysmal dyskinesias and had some seizures so neurology have assessed him, and oncology have treated him for multiple Mast Cell tumours and rectal lymphoma.\nErnie had surgical removal of multiple mast cell tumours in May 2016 one of which was high grade so he had a course of chemotherapy consisting of vinblastine, prednisolone and chlorambucil, which he completed in January 2017.\nJust a year later, a lump developed on his anus which was sampled and surgically removed with a diagnosis of anal epitheliotropic lymphoma. Our oncology depart were able to treat Ernie again with LOP protocol chemotherapy consisting of lomustine, vincristine and prednisolene over 6 months..\nDespite everything he has been through Ernie has remained a happy and content boy and with the help of Davies is continuing to defy all the odds!\nFind out more:\nClick here\nto find out more about Davies Veterinary Specialists Oncology service.\nWe have a useful fact sheet for pet owners on cutaneous mast cell tunours in dogs.\nClick here to read it.\nShare this article on social media\nAnaesthesia\nCardiology\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency & Critical Care\nPet Hearing Assessment Clinic\nInternal Medicine\nVeterinary Neurology and Neurosurgery\nVeterinary Nursing\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nOrthopaedics\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nTherapy and Fitness Services\nVeterinary Client Care\nAbout Us\nDavies Veterinary Specialists FAQs\nJoin Our Team\nSustainability\nLinnaeus Veterinary Limited trading as Davies Veterinary Specialists\nManor Farm Business Park\n|\nHigham Gobion\n|\nHertfordshire\n|\nSG5 3HR\n|\nTel 01582 883950\nRegistered address: Friars Gate 1011 Stratford Road Solihull B90 4BN\n|\nRegistered in England & Wales 10790375\n|\nVAT Reg 195 092 877\nCookie Settings\n© 2026 Davies Veterinary Specialists,\nPart of Linnaeus, an Affiliate of Mars, Incorporated\nHosting and Maintenance by Clickingmad\nTerms of Service (New)\nTerms of Service (Old)\nLegal Notice\nPrivacy Statement\nCookies Policy\nModern Slavery Act\nCustomer Charter\nComplaints\nGender Pay Gap Report\nAccessibility\nLinnaeus Veterinary Limited trading as Davies Veterinary Specialists\n01582 883950\n©2026 Davies Veterinary Specialists",
